# PRIVATE (미방송분). Cut NG-02: the same alley as chapter 1: Mijeong raises her head and looks into the lens ("I feel I have seen you somewhere")
@palette ../../../art/palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../cuts/ng02.png
@preview ../previews/ng02_x2.png 2
@swap ../palette/linear.pal
@fill D

@tiles w mbs_tiles_workroom.pix
